    "created_at": "2020-04-07T13:18:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-07T13:18:40Z",
    "body": "FWIW, Chromium [does look](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/master:net/http/http_response_headers.cc;l=1006?q=Pragma:%20no-cache%20f:.cc&originalUrl=https:%2F%2Fcs.chromium.org%2F) as `Pragma: no-cache` as an alias for `Cache-Control: no-cache`, claiming backwards compat issues with removing it. Might be interesting to add counters and see how many resources would get step being revalidated if that changed. ",
